---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Dext vs Hubdoc for bookkeeping firms — receipt capture compared"
  description="Side-by-side: Dext and Hubdoc for receipt and bill capture in small accounting practices. Pricing, Xero fit, and when to pick each."
>
  <h1>Dext vs Hubdoc</h1>
  <p>Both pull receipts and bills into the ledger. Pick by stack and who pays.</p>

  <table>
    <thead><tr><th></th><th><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/tools/dext`}>Dext</a></th><th><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/tools/hubdoc`}>Hubdoc</a></th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>Best for</td><td>Multi-ledger practices (Xero + QBO) needing richer extraction credits</td><td>Xero-only practices that want capture included in the sub</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Pricing (verified Oct 2026)</td><td>Business from ~$31.50/mo (250 docs, 5 users); practices priced per client (10-client minimum)</td><td>Included with qualifying Xero plans when connected; standalone ~$12/mo</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Ledgers</td><td>Xero, QuickBooks Online, and others</td><td>Strongest with Xero; also QBO on standalone</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Capture</td><td>Email, mobile, upload; bank/line-item/supplier extraction credits</td><td>Email, mobile, upload, auto-fetch from suppliers</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Firm angle</td><td>Partner plans scale per client with Essentials/Advanced</td><td>Free Hubdoc practice account for Xero partners; client orgs inherit inclusion</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>When to choose Dext</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>You run mixed Xero and QuickBooks clients.</li>
    <li>You need bank-statement or line-item extraction beyond basic OCR.</li>
    <li>You want practice-level workflow/insights on Advanced partner plans.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>When to choose Hubdoc</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Clients are already on Xero Lite/Starter/Standard/Premium (or US Early/Growing/Established).</li>
    <li>You want zero extra capture cost on those plans.</li>
    <li>Auto-fetching utility and bank PDFs into Xero is the main job.</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/category/receipt-capture`}>All receipt &amp; document capture tools</a></p>
</Base>

<style>
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
  th { background: #f6f6f6; }
</style>
